    "information": {
      "description": "<p><em>Undersea powered armor kept deep-sea research and repair crews alive for decades, and the Ocean War turned the old Gorgon into a torpedo platform. Hydrosubsidium's new model drops most of the old thinking machinery and adds speed, plus enough tools to see off stray drones and bioforms. Rumor says one island nation has already converted a squadron into battlesuits.</em></p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 36,900eb (Super Luxury)<br><strong>Frame / Shell:</strong> Omega / Light Metalgear®<br><strong>Stats:</strong> 42 HP • 16 SP • BODY 16 • +2 MOVE • −1 REF • −1 DEX<br><strong>Onboard weapons:</strong> Centurion Essentials Thermo-Dirk (Laser Welder), Everest Ventureware Beacon, Microwaver w/ Long Barrel, Shrieker w/ Long Barrel<br><strong>Onboard cyberware:</strong> Techscanner (arm), Shoulder Cam, Tool Hand, TUp (works underwater as a winch) Grapple Hand, Web Foot</p><p>One pilot. The suit's stats modify the pilot's; see the Item Compendium, Power Armor.</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Power Armor</small></p>",
      "alias": "",
      "history": "",
      "notes": ""
